  "details": "In my opinion the Picture is too big, I would like it to be as big as the text part of the nameplate. Not bigger. Especially when turning opacity to 0 the picture overwhelms that tiny name.\nI can see how the size of the picture would look alright on long usernames, but on short names like mine it doesn't fit. and while I want big names (am on Vive), I don't want huge pictures to accompany them. Disabling them outright might be fine for me when that comes available, but having them smaller would be good enough for me.",
